/* C oracle for melee_fighter::tu::ftdynamics (generated by gen/mtu/mkdriver.py from gen/mtu/specs/ftdynamics.json): the whole TU included
 * verbatim, every callee out of it a recording stub (gen/mtu/stubs.py), a random three-fighter world filled field by
 * field (gen/mtu/fill.py). Each line: op case ret state-hash trace. */
